{"text":"purananuru","n":344,"lines":["செந்நெல் உண்ட பைந்தோட்டு மஞ்ஞை","செறிவளை மகளிர் பறந்தெழுந்து","துறைநணி மருதத்து இறுக்கும் ஊரொடு","நிறைசால் விழுப்பொருள் தருதல் ஒன்றோ","புகைபடு கூர்எரி பரப்பிப் பகைசெய்து","பண்பில் ஆண்மை தருதல் ஒன்றோ","இரண்டினுள் ஒன்றா காமையோ அரிதே","காஞ்சிப் பனிமுறி ஆரங் கண்ணி …","கணிமே வந்தவள் அல்குல்அவ் வரியே"],"tr":["cennel uṇṭa paintōṭṭu maññai","ceṟivaḷai makaḷir paṟanteḻuntu","tuṟainaṇi marutattu iṟukkum ūroṭu","niṟaicāl viḻupporuḷ tarutal oṉṟō","pukaipaṭu kūreri parappip pakaiceytu","paṇpil āṇmai tarutal oṉṟō","iraṇṭiṉuḷ oṉṟā kāmaiyō aritē","kāñcip paṉimuṟi āraṅ kaṇṇi","kaṇimē vantavaḷ alkulav variyē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"kāñci","tinai_ta":"காஞ்சி","turai_ta":"மகட்பாற் காஞ்சி","poet_ta":"அடைநெடுங் கல்வியார்","addressed_ta":"பெயர் தெரிந்திலது","poet_tr":"Aṭaineṭuṅ Kalviyār"},"scan":{"meter":"nilaimaṇṭila āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"9 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"9×4 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 34, veṇcīr 2"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"āciriyattaḷai 17, veṇṭaḷai 17, kalittaḷai 1"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"செந்நெ","tr":"cenne","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"செந்","tr":"cen"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"நெ","tr":"ne"}]},{"text":"லுண்ட","tr":"luṇṭa","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"லுண்","tr":"luṇ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ட","tr":"ṭa"}]},{"text":"பைந்தோட்","tr":"paintōṭ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"பைந்","tr":"pain"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தோட்","tr":"tōṭ"}]},{"text":"டுமஞ்ஞை","tr":"ṭumaññai","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"டுமஞ்","tr":"ṭumañ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ஞை","tr":"ñai"}]}],[{"text":"செறிவளை","tr":"ceṟivaḷai","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"செறி","tr":"ceṟi"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"வளை","tr":"vaḷai"}]},{"text":"மகளிர்","tr":"makaḷir","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"மக","tr":"maka"},{"kind":"n